+``android-video-rect``
+    Where an Android application must place the video Surface of
+    ``--vo=mediacodec_embed``, as ``w:h:left:top:right:bottom``. MediaCodec
+    scales every frame to the whole Surface, so aspect, crop, zoom and pan only
+    apply once the Surface covers this rectangle of the ``w`` x ``h`` OSD
+    Surface, where subtitles are placed with the same geometry. The rectangle
+    spans the whole decoded frame and can extend past the viewport.
+    Unavailable until video is configured and while
+    ``--android-video-surface-transform`` delegates the layout.
